{{en-verb}}

# To [[treat]] with [[potassium]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1910|title=Platers' Guide: With which is Combined Brass World |author= |page= |ISBN= |passage=In order to ascertain the difference between the rapidity of pickling when the tin frames had been '''potashed''' and pickling without such treatment, two batches were used.  }}
